  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe3c7bd4172c8f045ab467a8425b9947, type: 3}
  m_Name: Pisser
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - lineText: Dude you just peed inside wtf!
    speakerName: Thabo
  - lineText: Well this is my room so unless you want to sleep outside get use to
      the smell
    speakerName: Man
  - lineText: Well I am Thabo by the way what is your name. (It is just one night)
    speakerName: Thabo
  - lineText: I am Trevor but I am sure you saw what happened out front with Lebo
      right?
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: Wait, I did see that so that is Lebo what did he do?
    speakerName: Thabo
  - lineText: 'Well it is a long story but he got framed which is why he was kicked
      out. '
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: Why are you telling me this?
    speakerName: Thabo
  - lineText: Everyone thinks I am crazy because I belive Lebo was framed everyone
      else does not
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: except for James, he was just doing his job. I am sure he told you,
      you look harmless.
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: Yes he did
    speakerName: Thabo
  - lineText: I need to know that I can trust you, because we need your help to prove
      Lebos
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: innocence. An outsider is the best person to go around and ask questions
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: will you help us?
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: I barely know you why should I help, I just want to sleep and get out
      of here.
    speakerName: Thabo
  - lineText: Our kids are gone.
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: 'And they kicked out the only man who knew where they are, I want to
      know '
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: why?
    speakerName: Trevor
  - lineText: Fine, I ask around and try to find out what happened for the kids.
    speakerName: Thabo
